menu "opencoloplayv1 BSP"

    config BSP_GC9A01_SPI_CLK_HZ
        int "GC9A01 SPI clock (Hz)"
        range 1000000 80000000
        default 40000000
        help
            SPI clock for the GC9A01 panel. The product firmware runs the bus
            at 80 MHz in half-duplex SIO mode; 40 MHz is a safe default for
            the esp_lcd stack. Raise it if the panel keeps up.

    config BSP_GC9A01_BACKLIGHT_DEFAULT_DUTY
        int "Backlight default duty (percent)"
        range 0 100
        default 70
        help
            Backlight PWM duty applied when the display is initialized.

endmenu
